  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). A glasswing so coated in ash it looks like smoke with a beak. Its wingbeat throws an ash cone that weakens, and it swoops down a line. At half health it takes to the air: a dust devil follows the farthest player (keep it away from the group) and ash clouds hang where it sheds.",
